n to the core, the flesh and skin","translation":"살과 피부를 벗겨 속까지 들여다봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":141.0,"end":144.76,"text":"See how their love is thin","translation":"그들의 사랑이 얼마나 얇은지 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":145.18,"end":147.9,"text":"Don't you ever give in","translation":"절대로 굴복하지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":147.9,"end":150.48,"text":"Camelia","translation":"카멜리아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":161.92,"end":164.7,"text":"I pulled the trigger","translation":"내가 방아쇠를 당겼어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":164.7,"end":166.28,"text":"Bang Bang","translation":"탕 탕","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":166.28,"end":169.3,"text":"Though unlike in the movies","translation":"영화 속 장면과는 달리","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":169.3,"end":171.9,"text":"So loud it screamed","translation":"너무 크게 비명을 질렀어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":171.9,"end":175.3,"text":"We forget about killed swine","translation":"죽은 돼지는 잊어도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":175.41,"end":178.6,"text":"But the pain will not be gone","translation":"고통은 사라지지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":178.62,"end":181.32,"text":"Echoing down the corridor","translation":"복도를 타고 울려 퍼지는","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":181.94,"end":184.4,"text":"The soul of a naked man","translation":"벌거벗은 남자의 영혼은","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":184.4,"end":186.7,"text":"Looking for more","translation":"더 많은 걸 찾아 헤매","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":187.55,"end":190.18,"text":"Looks like you still stand","translation":"아직도 서 있네","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":190.68,"end":192.42,"text":"Let me finish you","translation":"내가 끝내 줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":192.42,"end":193.6,"text":"Bang bang bang","translation":"탕 탕 탕","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":193.6,"end":196.84,"text":"Remember to put on silencer","translation":"소음기 다는 걸 잊지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":197.48,"end":202.16,"text":"Exactly like our mother's words","translation":"어머니가 하신 말씀 그대로","kind":"ly